(7557067, 1210642, 65234, '<td valign="top">STUNNING detail, I can even see reflections in his eyes. Really remarkable macro (and I think jumping spiders are adorable!).</td>', 'STUNNING detail, I can even see reflections in his eyes. Really remarkable macro (and I think jumping spiders are adorable!).', '2018-02-02 11:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
