(7557077, 1211229, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous, vibrant scene! Jealous.</td>', 'What a gorgeous, vibrant scene! Jealous.', '2018-02-02 11:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557080, 1211069, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hashtag, really? In case anyone wouldn''t think of that in conjunction with the city? I''m officially old ''cuz that just seems weird to me.<br/> <br/>Back to the image - nice sharpness on the foreground, especially that reflection, and a very hot city in the back. The bird is a nice addition.</td>', 'Hashtag, really? In case anyone wouldn''t think of that in conjunction with the city? I''m officially old ''cuz that just seems weird to me. Back to the image - nice sharpness on the foreground, especially that reflection, and a very hot city in the back. The bird is a nice addition.', '2018-02-02 11:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557081, 1211044, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a cutie! Personally, would love just a touch more DOF to get the mouth in focus, but you got the important part.</td>', 'What a cutie! Personally, would love just a touch more DOF to get the mouth in focus, but you got the important part.', '2018-02-02 12:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557082, 1211240, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wish I could have seen the moon turn red, but I live on the wrong coast for that &lt;sigh&gt;. The moon is lovely and I like the faint light on the tower. It looks just a wee bit tilted to me, though, and compositionally it feels unbalanced. Still a very good image.</td>', 'Wish I could have seen the moon turn red, but I live on the wrong coast for that <sigh>. The moon is lovely and I like the faint light on the tower. It looks just a wee bit tilted to me, though, and compositionally it feels unbalanced. Still a very good image.', '2018-02-02 12:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557083, 1209880, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer a smooth background, I think, and softer lighting. Not sure about the composition but I have no idea what''s the most interesting way to arrange such objects.</td>', 'I''d prefer a smooth background, I think, and softer lighting. Not sure about the composition but I have no idea what''s the most interesting way to arrange such objects.', '2018-02-02 12:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557084, 1211143, 65234, '<td valign="top">DOF adds interest to a common object. I probably would have composed it as coming up from the lower right corner (same angle to the pen), which is admittedly more conventional.</td>', 'DOF adds interest to a common object. I probably would have composed it as coming up from the lower right corner (same angle to the pen), which is admittedly more conventional.', '2018-02-02 12:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
