(7558206, 1211261, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the open challenge well<br/> <br/>What a lovely image Janine. The mono processing works really well. I love the perspective and compression in this its absolutely lovely. I like your portrait orientated composition it really stretches those slender trunks for all they''re worth. Its all a delightful image, a great title too, nicely done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the open challenge well What a lovely image Janine. The mono processing works really well. I love the perspective and compression in this its absolutely lovely. I like your portrait orientated composition it really stretches those slender trunks for all they''re worth. Its all a delightful image, a great title too, nicely done.', '2018-02-08 11:37:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7558215, 1210961, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, Paul!  <br/> <br/>About how many takes to get this beauty??</td>', 'Nicely done, Paul!   About how many takes to get this beauty??', '2018-02-08 11:58:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7558216, 1209880, 38162, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 10 - sadly abstracts and geometrics are totally lost on this crowd.  this is the land of stock and commercial photogs.  let me know if there is a similar group online with more open minds.  keep at it. gl.<br/></td>', 'I gave it a 10 - sadly abstracts and geometrics are totally lost on this crowd.  this is the land of stock and commercial photogs.  let me know if there is a similar group online with more open minds.  keep at it. gl.', '2018-02-08 12:02:19.000000', NULL, 0),
