(7558687, 1210767, 47974, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for all the comments and votes, really appreciate it.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=25024" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Sidpixel</a>. I wish it was bigger but cant get everything.  In the print it is really easy to see the catch.<br/> <br/>For those wondering, the print does look absolutely amazing.  Waiting to get my 40x30 of another shot of this bird from getting framed.  Cant wait to hang both of them in my office.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for all the comments and votes, really appreciate it.  Sidpixel. I wish it was bigger but cant get everything.  In the print it is really easy to see the catch. For those wondering, the print does look absolutely amazing.  Waiting to get my 40x30 of another shot of this bird from getting framed.  Cant wait to hang both of them in my office.', '2018-02-10 18:24:02.000000', NULL, 0),
